      "content": "Empowering individual students and allowing them to choose the best possible educational path does tap into a fundamental principle of education: personalization and student-centered learning. By letting students and their families choose the school that best meets their needs, educators can use resources more efficiently and effectively, tailoring teaching methods to each child's learning style. Ultimately, this approach seemed to align more closely with the ideals of educators who genuinely prioritize student success.",
